Task: Build a Fully Dynamic, Multi-Project Reusable Backend Package

You are working inside an existing production codebase.

The objective is to analyze the existing implementation and extract the common backend functionality into a fully reusable, configurable, multi-project NPM package.

This package will be reused across multiple future projects.

The package must NOT be designed specifically for the current project.

The current project is only the reference implementation from which reusable functionality should be extracted.

The final architecture must allow:

Project A
    ↓
uses package

Project B
    ↓
uses same package

Project C
    ↓
uses same package

without modifying the package source code for each project.

