13. SUPER ADMIN IS REQUIRED

Every project MUST have a default Super Admin.

When a new project is initialized:

Create Project
      ↓
Create default Super Admin
      ↓
Assign Super Admin role
      ↓
Super Admin belongs to that project

The Super Admin must NOT be a global user unless explicitly designed otherwise.

Each project gets its own Super Admin.

Example:

Project A
 └── Super Admin A

Project B
 └── Super Admin B

Project C
 └── Super Admin C

14. SUPER ADMIN CONFIGURATION

